# Normalise to LF in the repository. The site builds on Linux in CI; committing CRLF
# would make every cross-platform diff noisy for no benefit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Cached wikitext is gitignored, but mark it binary-ish if it ever appears so that a
# stray add cannot produce a 60,000-line diff.
*.wikitext -text -diff
